# TypeStack web client — environment configuration.
#
# Every variable here is OPTIONAL. The defaults work for local development
# where Vite proxies `/api` to the dockerized server. Production / Vercel
# deployments only need to set VITE_API_BASE.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` to override per-machine. Vercel reads its
# own values from the project dashboard.

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# VITE_API_BASE
# Where the web client fetches the TypeStack API.
#   • local dev:        leave unset; Vite proxies /api → http://localhost:3001
#   • Vercel preview:   https://api-staging.example.com/api
#   • production:       https://api.example.com/api
# Must include the /api suffix and have NO trailing slash.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# VITE_API_BASE=https://api.example.com/api
